  ],
  "en": "...But because of me, big sis, you're...!!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00e32",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "キロタ・・",
   "寂しい想いさせて・・・",
   "ごめんね"
  ],
  "en": "Kilota... I'm sorry... for leaving you so lonely..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00e74",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "私は・・いいお姉ちゃんじゃ",
