  ],
  "en": "I wasn't... a good big sister..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00eca",
  "speaker": 17,
  "jp": [
   "そんなことない！",
   "カルディアお姉ちゃんはいつでも",
   "僕達のことを想ってたッ！！"
  ],
  "en": "That's not true! Cardia-neesan always thought of us!!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00f42",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "・・・・・・"
  ],
  "en": "......"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00f76",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "僕にはちゃんと",
   "聞こえていたんだ！"
  ],
  "en": "I could hear you! I really could!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00fba",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "だから、僕は生き残れたんだ・・"
  ],
  "en": "That's why I survived..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/00fec",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "苦痛をともなう実験の中で",
   "正気でいられたのは",
   "お姉ちゃん達の声が聞こえたから"
  ],
  "en": "Through all those painful experiments, I stayed sane because I heard your voices."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0105e",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "帰りたいと、思ったから・・・",
   "生きて・・みんなと一緒に・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Because I wanted to go home... to live... with everyone..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/010c6",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "キロタ・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Kilota..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/010f2",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "うぅっ！！"
  ],
  "en": "Ugh!!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01168",
  "speaker": 17,
  "jp": [
   "姉さんっ！"
  ],
  "en": "Neesan!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0119a",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "ステイ",
   "お願いが、あるの・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Stay... I have a favor to ask..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/011e2",
  "speaker": 17,
  "jp": [
   "いいから、姉さん",
   "もう喋らないで！！！"
  ],
  "en": "Stop it, Neesan, don't talk anymore!!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01224",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "聞いて・・・ステイ",
   "エンブリオンを操るのは",
   "ホワイトフェイスなの・・"
  ],
  "en": "Listen... Stay. The one controlling the Embryon... is Whiteface..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01296",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "ホワイトフェイスが",
   "エンブリオンを？？？"
  ],
  "en": "Whiteface is controlling the Embryon!?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/012e2",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "何よそれ・・",
   "ホワイトフェイスって言ったら",
   "十審将の一人でしょ？！"
  ],
  "en": "What? Whiteface is one of the Ten Tribunal Generals, isn't he!?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01352",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "ホワイトフェイスは、",
