   "だから早く・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Whiteface means... to make the world his own... So hurry..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/013ba",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "早く、ベイル様にこのことを",
   "伝えて・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Hurry... tell Bale-sama about this..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0140e",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "わかったわ！！",
   "それをベイルに伝えればいいのね"
  ],
  "en": "Got it!! I just have to tell Bale, right?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01466",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "ステイエン・・・",
   "貴方にも、寂しい想いをさせて",
   "ごめんね・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Stayen... I'm sorry I left you lonely too..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/014d2",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "姉さん・・・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Neesan......"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01502",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "いいのよ、姉さん"
  ],
  "en": "It's okay, Neesan."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01524",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "姉さんももっと",
   "わがままを言って・・"
  ],
  "en": "You should be more selfish too, Neesan..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0156a",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "そしたら、あたしも",
   "姉さんにたくさんわがままを",
   "言っちゃうんだから・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Then I'll be plenty selfish with you too..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/015de",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "・・・・・・・・・・"
  ],
  "en": "......"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01612",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "ありがとう・・・ステイエン"
  ],
  "en": "Thank you... Stayen."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01688",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "・・・姉さん？"
  ],
  "en": "...Neesan?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/016be",
  "speaker": 17,
  "jp": [
   "カルディア姉さん？！"
  ],
  "en": "Cardia-neesan!?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/017b2",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "僕が・・・いけないんだ"
  ],
  "en": "It's... my fault."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/017f2",
  "speaker": 1,
  "jp": [
   "僕をかばったせいで、",
