   "そんなの違うわよ"
  ],
  "en": "Your fault? That's not it at all."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0189e",
  "speaker": 1,
  "jp": [
   "違わなくなんかないよ！！",
   "僕がもっとちゃんとしていたら",
   "お姉ちゃんは死ななかった！"
  ],
  "en": "It is!! If I'd done better, big sis wouldn't have died!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0191e",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "僕が・・・",
   "僕が死ねば良かったんだッ！！！"
  ],
  "en": "I... I should've been the one to die!!!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01a1c",
  "speaker": 1,
  "jp": [
   "！！"
  ],
  "en": "!!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01a4a",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "・・・痛いでしょ？",
   "でも、死ぬのはもっと痛いのよ？"
  ],
  "en": "...That hurts, doesn't it? But dying hurts a lot more, you know?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01aa6",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "・・・・・・っ"
  ],
  "en": "......"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01ade",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "あんたが死ぬのを見たくないから",
