  ],
  "en": "She didn't want to see you die, so she chose to shield you. That's all it was."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01b56",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "別にあんたの代わりに",
   "死のうと思ったわけじゃない"
