  "en": "......But!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01d34",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "人の死は、唐突なものよ"
  ],
  "en": "Death comes suddenly."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01d5c",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "信じられなくても",
   "信じたくなくても",
   "いなくなった人は戻らない"
  ],
  "en": "Whether you can't believe it or don't want to, the ones who are gone don't come back."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01db0",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "それだけは",
   "くつがえしようのない事実だよ"
  ],
  "en": "That much is a fact nothing can overturn."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01df4",
