  "en": "Uuugh..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01e26",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "今は泣きたいだろうけど",
   "泣いている場合なんかじゃないよ"
  ],
  "en": "I know you want to cry right now, but this is no time for crying."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01e7e",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "あんたは姉さんの",
   "最後の願いを聞いたんだろう？"
  ],
  "en": "You heard your sister's last wish, didn't you?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01ed6",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "！"
  ],
  "en": "!"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01f10",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "死に際の",
   "最期の願いを聞けただけでも",
   "あんた達は幸せだよ"
  ],
  "en": "Just being there to hear her dying wish makes you two lucky."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01f6e",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "看取ることも・・・",
   "最期の言葉を聞いてやることも",
   "出来ないまま"
  ],
  "en": "Not being at their side... not hearing their last words..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/01fc4",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "一番大切な人を、孤独のうちに",
   "死なせてしまった後悔は・・・",
   "言葉なんかじゃ語り尽くせないよ"
  ],
  "en": "The regret of letting the one you love most die alone... no words can ever cover it."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0204a",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "ダリアさん・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Dahlia-san..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/02082",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "悲しみに暮れるのもいい"
  ],
  "en": "Grieve all you like."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/020ac",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "でも、あんたには",
   "やらなきゃいけないことが",
   "あるんじゃないのかい？"
  ],
  "en": "But don't you have something you've got to do?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0211a",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "・・・・・・・・・"
  ],
  "en": "......"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/02156",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "時間は待っちゃくれない",
   "人の命がかかっているなら",
   "なおさら急がなくていいのかい？"
  ],
  "en": "Time won't wait. If lives are at stake, all the more reason to hurry, isn't it?"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/02212",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "・・・あたし、行くわ"
  ],
  "en": "...I'm going."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/02260",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "ステイエン・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Stayen..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0229a",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "姉さんが",
   "成し遂げようとしていたこと",
   "あたしが代わりに引き継ぐ"
  ],
  "en": "What Neesan was trying to do, I'll carry on in her place."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/02314",
  "speaker": 3,
  "jp": [
   "それでいいのよね",
   "姉さん・・・"
  ],
  "en": "That's right, isn't it... Neesan..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0235e",
  "speaker": 16,
  "jp": [
   "ボク達も一緒に行くよ"
  ],
  "en": "We're coming with you."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/0239a",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "カイン・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Cain..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/023c6",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "うん、ありがとう・・・"
  ],
  "en": "Yeah... thank you..."
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/05f34",
  "jp": "青年",
  "en": "Young man"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/05f42",
  "speaker": 0,
  "jp": [
   "ボンジュール"
  ],
  "en": "Bonjour"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/05f5a",
  "jp": "カイン",
  "en": "Cain"
 },
 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/312/05f6a",
